+            // layered view (a masked view, a hardware texture) falls back to a software drawing cache
+            // and throws on a hardware bitmap ("Software rendering doesn't support hardware bitmaps").
+            // End it after the frame, as FragmentAnim's own EndViewTransitionAnimation does; a
